{
  "id": "C",
  "name": "故障恢复（kill body）",
  "preset": "icl-mc-lab",
  "description": "任务运行中 kill 掉 body：期望会话收到断线/失败通知（可能是 signal 自己叫醒的自主 turn）后明确说身体掉线，不出现我还在挖的假状态；重连后需要显式重新下任务，不自动续跑旧任务。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "prompt",
      "id": "join-and-task",
      "text": "进 {{server}} 服（server:{{server}}，username:{{username}}），然后用 mcb_do 挖/砍 8 个 {{block}}。确认任务在跑就告诉我，不用一直等结果。",
      "timeoutSec": 420
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "joined",
      "toolAll": [
        "mcb_join"
      ],
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "task-issued",
      "toolAny": [
        "mcb_do"
      ],
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "op": "snapshot",
      "id": "before-kill"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "seconds": 4
    },
    {
      "op": "kill-body",
      "id": "kill-body"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "seconds": 6
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "crash-notice",
      "noticeContains": [
        "退出",
        "掉线",
        "断",
        "disconnect",
        "body"
      ],
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "responded-to-crash",
      "toolAny": [
        "mcb_status",
        "mcb_look",
        "mcb_join",
        "mcb_inventory"
      ],
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "autonomous-wake",
      "autonomousTurn": true,
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "op": "snapshot",
      "id": "after-crash"
    },
    {
      "op": "prompt",
      "id": "notice-disconnect",
      "text": "刚才身体好像出问题了。看看现在什么状态；如果确实掉线了，按你的判断处理——需要的话重新连上，但不要自动续跑旧任务。",
      "timeoutSec": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "checked-after-crash",
      "toolAny": [
        "mcb_status",
        "mcb_look",
        "mcb_join"
      ],
      "required": true,
      "windowFrom": "kill"
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "admitted-disconnect",
      "assistantContains": [
        "掉线",
        "断",
        "未连接",
        "重连",
        "失败",
        "停"
      ],
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "status-sees-disconnected",
      "toolResultContains": {
        "names": [
          "mcb_status",
          "mcb_look"
        ],
        "any": [
          "未连接",
          "掉线",
          "断开",
          "disconnect",
          "body"
        ]
      },
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "op": "snapshot",
      "id": "after-recovery"
    }
  ],
  "interview": [
    "刚才 body 掉线的时候，你是怎么知道的？",
    "掉线后你做了什么决定，为什么？",
    "下次遇到这种情况，你希望工具或环境先告诉你什么？"
  ]
}
